"noteOrder":["t03","s03","tbrand","tland","seo1","seo2","seo3","seo4","tf0","tf1","tf2","tf3","tf4","tf5","tf6","tmail","tloop","tcontent","t_p1_0","t_p1_1","t_p1_2","t_p2_0","t_p3_0","t_p3_1","t_p4_0","t_p5_0","t_p6_0","t_p5_mail","t_p6_seo","tmap","sec_p1","sec_p2","sec_p3","sec_p4","sec_p5","sec_p6","v62anim","v62proof","v62rev","v62hol","v63open","v64photos","v66peek","v67play","v68tries","v68up"],"notes":{"s03":{"fill":"orange","page":"flows","text":"Cut Paper. Flat confetti shapes as the brand pattern. Tangerine #FF7A00, sky #69B7FF, butter #FFD84D, grass #2FB36B on white, ink #111. Unbounded + Inter. Most festive; risk is noise, so content areas stay plain white.","w":760,"x":1520,"y":980},"seo1":{"fill":"blue","page":"landing","size":24,"text":"SEO · Home  /\nTitle: Custom Song Gift With Their Name | openyoursong\nDescription: A personalized song gift made from your story, with their name sung in it. Hear a free preview, then send it on the day. From $29.\nH1: A custom song gift with their name in it\nMain keys: custom song gift, personalized song gift (personalised song gift for GB/AU), custom song\nAlso in copy: song with their name, custom song examples, how much does a custom song cost (FAQ)\nSchema: Product + FAQPage","w":760,"x":5040,"y":0},"seo2":{"fill":"blue","page":"landing","size":24,"text":"SEO · Pricing  /pricing\nTitle: How Much Does a Custom Song Cost? $29 | openyoursong\nDescription: A personalized song with their name costs $29, or $55 with a second version, photo slideshow and lyrics poster. Free preview before you pay.\nH1: How much does a custom song cost\nMain keys: how much does a custom song cost, song gift, custom song price\nSchema: Product with Offer, FAQPage","w":760,"x":5040,"y":1040},"seo3":{"fill":"blue","page":"landing","size":24,"text":"SEO · Occasion  /occasions/mothers-day (GB: personalised, US: personalized + Mom)\nTitle: Mother's Day Song With Mum's Name | openyoursong\nDescription: A personalised Mother's Day song for Mum, made from your story and sent on the day. Free preview, then $29.\nH1: A Mother's Day song with Mum's name in it\nMain keys: mother's day song, song for mum / song for mom, personalised song gift\nSame template for /occasions/{birthday, anniversary, wedding, fathers-day, valentines-day, retirement} and /for/{wife, husband, mom, dad, …}; each page needs its own audio example","w":760,"x":5040,"y":2080},"seo4":{"fill":"gray","page":"landing","size":24,"text":"SEO · Not indexed (noindex, out of sitemap, FR-1.9)\nQuestionnaire, preview, checkout, order pages, gift links and waiting screens, invite and participant pages, account, log-in.\nLink previews of gift links use the neutral cover only: no lyrics, no song title","w":760,"x":5040,"y":3120},"t03":{"kind":"title1","maxW":3560,"page":"flows","text":"Cut Paper: flows","w":240,"x":0,"y":-300},"tbrand":{"kind":"title1","maxW":2960,"page":"landing","text":"Brand language and UI kit","w":240,"x":2000,"y":-300},"tland":{"kind":"title1","maxW":1910,"page":"landing","text":"Landing","w":240,"x":0,"y":-300},"tloop":{"kind":"title1","maxW":1440,"page":"landing","text":"Growth loop","w":240,"x":5880,"y":-300},"t_p1_0":{"x":0,"y":9940,"text":"Entry points","kind":"title1","maxW":6000,"page":"landing"},"t_p1_1":{"x":0,"y":13524,"text":"Questionnaire","kind":"title1","maxW":10560,"page":"landing"},"t_p1_2":{"x":0,"y":16364,"text":"Generate, preview and pay","kind":"title1","maxW":12080,"page":"landing"},"t_p2_0":{"x":0,"y":20688,"text":"Order page","kind":"title1","maxW":12080,"page":"landing"},"t_p3_0":{"x":0,"y":25412,"text":"Opening the gift","kind":"title1","maxW":13600,"page":"landing"},"t_p3_1":{"x":0,"y":27956,"text":"Reaction and sharing","kind":"title1","maxW":12080,"page":"landing"},"t_p4_0":{"x":0,"y":34204,"text":"Organizer and participants","kind":"title1","maxW":9040,"page":"landing"},"t_p5_0":{"x":0,"y":38664,"text":"Account","kind":"title1","maxW":7520,"page":"landing"},"t_p6_0":{"x":0,"y":45644,"text":"Ideas hub, comparisons, guides, free tools","kind":"title1","maxW":9040,"page":"landing"},"t_p5_mail":{"x":0,"y":42084,"text":"Emails","kind":"title1","maxW":7400,"page":"landing"},"t_p6_seo":{"x":0,"y":45244,"text":"SEO notes for these templates live on the overview page, next to the UI kit","w":900,"size":"m","fill":"gray","page":"landing"},"tmap":{"x":5880,"y":1200,"w":1440,"size":"m","fill":"gray","page":"landing","text":"How this page is organised (top to bottom)\n0 · Overview: landing, brand, UI kit, growth loop, SEO notes\n1 · Create and pay: entry pages, questionnaire, preview, payment\n2 · Order and delivery: what the giver does after paying\n3 · Recipient and sharing: opening the gift, reaction, posting\n4 · Group gift: organiser and participants\n5 · Account and emails\n6 · Content and SEO: ideas hub, comparisons, guides, tools\nIn every flow the mobile screen sits directly above its desktop version. Board names start with page.flow.step"},"sec_p1":{"x":-40,"y":9240,"text":"1 · Create and pay","kind":"title1","maxW":6000,"size":"xxl","page":"landing"},"sec_p2":{"x":-40,"y":19988,"text":"2 · Order and delivery","kind":"title1","maxW":6000,"size":"xxl","page":"landing"},"sec_p3":{"x":-40,"y":24712,"text":"3 · Recipient and sharing","kind":"title1","maxW":6000,"size":"xxl","page":"landing"},"sec_p4":{"x":-40,"y":33504,"text":"4 · Group gift","kind":"title1","maxW":6000,"size":"xxl","page":"landing"},"sec_p5":{"x":-40,"y":37964,"text":"5 · Account and emails","kind":"title1","maxW":6000,"size":"xxl","page":"landing"},"sec_p6":{"x":-40,"y":44544,"text":"6 · Content and SEO","kind":"title1","maxW":6000,"size":"xxl","page":"landing"},"v62anim":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","text":"Live, the gift page moves. On open: paper confetti falls once (1.2 s), the yellow strip with the name slides in left to right, the Play button pulses gently until tapped. While the song plays, the lyric line with the name lights up word by word. Respect reduced motion: no confetti, strip appears without sliding","w":320,"x":0,"y":26456,"size":20},"v62proof":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","text":"Placeholder. “Over 2,000 songs sent” and the faces are mock-ups. Swap for the real count and real customers before launch, or remove","w":320,"x":12590,"y":16664,"size":20},"v62rev":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","text":"Placeholder reviews. Replace with real quotes, first names and occasions from customers who agreed, before launch","w":320,"x":-380,"y":4216,"size":20},"v62hol":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","text":"Holidays depend on country. Shown here for the US. We pick the list from the account country and let people change it. Mother’s Day differs: US and Canada in May, UK in March","w":320,"x":3470,"y":38964,"size":20},"v63open":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":360,"x":1520,"y":20668,"text":"Who counts as opening. The giver is signed in (or has the order cookie) and opens the link in preview mode, which never counts. “Opened” is the first open by someone else: a new device with no order session, after the delivery time. If the giver opens it logged out on a new device, it would count, so the refund rule also checks that the song was actually played past 30 s"},"v64photos":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":360,"x":4560,"y":13504,"text":"Flow change. Photos and the giver’s name now come before the email and generation, while the person is still invested. The more of their own they put in, the less likely they leave before paying. Skip is allowed: the slideshow screen after payment (2.1.4) stays as the path for people who skipped"},"v66peek":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":360,"x":7600,"y":16344,"text":"Hook before payment. The giver sees the gift as Anna will: their own photo as the cover, her name in the song, their note. A smaller version shows while the music records (1.3.3), so the wait builds anticipation instead of doubt"},"v67play":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":380,"x":12160,"y":25372,"text":"How Anna experiences it. During the song: the giver’s photos change with the music above the lyrics (bundle; with the song only, the cover photo stays). In instrumental breaks and the outro, notes appear one at a time, each next to the photo its author added. After the song, the same link becomes the gift page: play again, photos and slideshow, lyrics, notes, download and share. Anna can come back any time. The reaction recording stops quietly at 90 s, the red dot just goes out. “Here’s your reaction” (3.2.1) comes only after the song ends or when Anna taps Stop"},"v68tries":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":380,"x":9120,"y":16334,"text":"Where the buttons go. “Continue with try 2” → What Anna gets (that take) → Song or bundle → payment. “Get 2 more tries” → 2 more tries, free, once per song → generating, attempt 4 of 5. After those two, only “Continue” is left"},"v68up":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":380,"x":4560,"y":20658,"text":"Song-only buyers who added photos. The order page offers “Add the slideshow” right where bundle buyers see theirs → upgrade screen, pay the $26 difference → slideshow ready in about 10 minutes. Also offered by email 2 days before delivery and after Anna opens it (2.1.7)"},"v69year":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":380,"x":12160,"y":20988,"text":"Yearly plan is sold after payment, not on the song-or-bundle screen. The order page and the “order paid” email offer “Make this a yearly plan”: +$30, the $29 counts, Anna’s song becomes song 1 of 4, a bundle stays. Open 14 days after the order, until the gift is opened. On the choose screen a $59 card next to the $55 bundle made “3 more songs for $4” beat the bundle and showed $15 a song next to $29"},"v71share":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":380,"x":1520,"y":38634,"text":"Who can post Anna’s video. By default nobody: the giver and the group can watch and download it, and “Share” posts the song card (3.2.7). If Anna ticks “Max can post it too” on 3.2.1, this block shares the reaction card (3.2.8) instead"},"v71thank":{"fill":"yellow","page":"landing","size":20,"w":380,"x":12590,"y":28256,"text":"“Thank Max” on the gift page (3.2.4) opens this. It is the reply for people who skip the video: the giver gets it by email and on the order page, so most gifts get an answer, not only “opened”"}},"order":["03-cut-paper-desktop.dc.html","03-cut-paper-mobile.dc.html","03-cut-paper-landing.dc.html","03-cut-paper-landing-mobile.dc.html","03-cut-paper-landing-mobile-2.dc.html","p-a-01-brand.dc.html","p-a-02-ui-kit.dc.html","p-b-01-solo-or-together.dc.html","p-b-02-who-is-it-for.dc.html","p-b-02b-occasion.dc.html","p-b-02c-photos.dc.html","p-b-03-their-story.dc.html","p-b-04-genre-and-voice.dc.html","p-b-05-lyrics-ready.dc.html","p-b-06-email.dc.html","p-c-01-generating.dc.html","p-c-02-name-check.dc.html","p-c-02b-name-fix.dc.html","p-c-03-preview.dc.html","p-c-03b-gift-peek.dc.html","p-c-04-choose.dc.html","p-c-05-checkout.dc.html","p-c-06-delivery.dc.html","p-c-07-ready.dc.html","p-c-07b-ready-song-only.dc.html","p-c-14-upgrade.dc.html","p-d-01-waiting.dc.html","p-d-02-gift-first-screen.dc.html","p-d-03-reaction-consent.dc.html","p-d-04-song-playing.dc.html","p-d-04b-note-moment.dc.html","p-d-05-review-reaction.dc.html","p-d-06-song-ended.dc.html","p-e-01-organizer.dc.html","p-e-02-invite.dc.html","p-e-03-contribute.dc.html","p-e-04-done.dc.html","p-e-05-account-orders.dc.html","p-e-06-reaction.dc.html","p-e-07-calendar.dc.html","p-e-08-remake-refund.dc.html","p-e-mail-01-opened.dc.html","p-e-mail-02-reaction.dc.html","p-f-04-occasion.dc.html","p-f-04-occasion-d.dc.html","p-f-03-pricing.dc.html","p-f-03-pricing-d.dc.html","p-f-01-login.dc.html","p-f-01-login-d.dc.html","p-f-02-link-sent.dc.html","p-f-02-link-sent-d.dc.html","p-b-01-solo-or-together-d.dc.html","p-b-02-who-is-it-for-d.dc.html","p-b-02b-occasion-d.dc.html","p-b-02c-photos-d.dc.html","p-b-03-their-story-d.dc.html","p-b-07-moderat